    "text" : " misreading them\" — but rejecting the read while permitting the write is worse than misreading, because misreading is recoverable and truncation is not. The   ",
    "web" : false,
    "width" : 1280,
    "x" : 0,
    "y" : 155.85714285714286
  },
  {
    "height" : 15.642857142857142,
